Port-only changes for adding Wonder Trade to a retail HeartGold or SoulSilver.

main.c keeps using the game's own main loop state: retail code outside
main.c reads and writes _02111864, and the functions main.c shares with
the game must see one overlay manager and backlight state.

diff --git a/src/main.c b/src/main.c
--- a/src/main.c
+++ b/src/main.c
@@ -38,9 +38,9 @@
     struct UnkStruct_02111868_sub unk_10;
 };
 
-int _02111864;
-PMBackLightSwitch gBacklightTop;
-struct UnkStruct_02111868 _02111868;
+extern int _02111864;
+extern PMBackLightSwitch gBacklightTop;
+extern struct UnkStruct_02111868 _02111868;
 
 static void sub_02000F60(void);
 static void DoSoftReset(u32 param);
